# Checkout must be byte-identical to the repository on every platform.
# The app, the launcher self-check and the benchmark verify files by SHA256
# (artifacts/model.json -> six frozen sources, artifacts/engine.json, the three
# release manifests, the protocol and rules files), so no line-ending conversion
# is allowed, whatever core.autocrlf says.  The repository keeps each file's
# original line endings (r13 shipped a mix of LF and CRLF); do not renormalise.
* -text

# Listed explicitly as well: a hash mismatch on these stops the app or the benchmark.
liushao/__init__.py -text
liushao/data.py -text
liushao/feature_metadata.py -text
liushao/model.py -text
liushao/reference.py -text
liushao/reviews.py -text
artifacts/* -text
artifacts/** -text
configs/*.json -text
